nav-bar
.container
  .row
    .col-12
      .jumbotron.jumbotron--blue-sky(style="margin-top:60px; position: relative;")
        .title-card About Edji
        h1.mt-2 From Will's classroom, to yours
        p
          | Edji started in the classroom of Will Stewart, a 5th-grade teacher who noticed a problem in his class. 
        p 
          | His students didn’t love reading, in fact, they barely tolerated it. When they read, they were disengaged and Will struggled to help them get excited about the text. He couldn’t blame them, the PDFs and articles were stuck in apps only really meant for viewing. His students were prohibited from writing down their thoughts, discussing with each other, and sharing comments with their teacher. Will dreamed of a way to engage students in reading in a way that allowed them to share their thoughts with him and their classmates, and he had an idea. He attended a Startup weekend event, where he formed the Edji dream team.
        p
          | Two and a half years later, Edji is the collaborative classroom reading tool that helps his students find their love for reading. Will uses it every day to share articles and listen to his students thoughts.
  .row.row-xl-pad
    .col-12
      h2.text-center.big-light Meet the Team
    .col-lg-3.col-md-4.col-sm-6.mb-4(*ngFor="let player of players")
      .player-card.card
        img.card-img([attr.src]="player.photo")
        .card-block
          .card-title 
            .emoji_wrap([innerHtml]="player.emoji | emojione")
            | {{ player.name }}        
          .player-title {{ player.title }}
          .mt-2
            label.mb-0 Favorite Book
            p {{ player.book }}
  .row.row-xl-pad
    .col-12
      .card.card-inverse.navy(style="overflow:hidden;")
        .card-block
          .row
            .col-lg-6(style="padding-bottom:40px;")
              h1.card-title Supporting Edji
              p.on-dark Edji is a small company, and we aren’t backed by large corporations or venture capital.  We love creating Edji and inspiring young minds to think differently about reading. 
              p.on-dark With each subscription to Edji Hero, you are letting us know that you enjoy Edji too. With your purchase, you are supporting more reliable Edji access and expanded features for both free and Hero users everywhere!
              a.btn.btn-hero([routerLink]="['/hero']") Support Edji
            .col-lg-6(style="min-height:350px;")
              img.map-fill(src="/assets/images/promo/mn-map-zoom.png")
       

